Uddata skriv: ['last index of d = '] + (( txt sidste: ['d'] ) - 0), stop.
Uddata skriv: ['txt equals Word Salad = '] + ( txt = ['Word Salad'] ), stop.
Uddata skriv: ['txt equals Ceasar Salad = '] + ( txt = ['Ceasar Salad'] ), stop.
Uddata skriv: ['txt does not equal Word Salad = '] + ( txt ≠ ['Word Salad'] ), stop.
Uddata skriv: ['txt does not equal Ceasar Salad = '] + ( txt ≠ ['Ceasar Salad'] ), stop.

